{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45379","headline":"裴端公使君清席赋得青桂歌送徐长史 · 皎然","name":"裴端公使君清席赋得青桂歌送徐长史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年攀桂爲留人，今朝攀桂送归客。\n秋风桃李摇落尽，爲君青青伴松柏。\n谢公南楼送客还，高歌桂树凌寒山。\n应怜独秀空林上，空赏敷华积雪间。\n昨夜一枝生在月，婵娟可望不可折。\n若爲天上堪赠行，徒使亭亭照离别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}